<title>FRANCE: RUGBY UNION-SPRINGBOKS WIN TOUR MATCH 36-20.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-SPRINGBOKS WIN TOUR MATCH 36-20.</headline>
<dateline>LYON, France 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa beat a French Southeast selection 36-20 (halftime 7-3) in the second match of their tour of France on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Southeast Selection - Tries: Laurent Leflamand, Eric Artiguste. Conversions: Benoit Bellot 2. Penalties: Bellot 2.</p>
<p>South Africa - Tries: Marius Hurter, Hannes Strydom, Justin Swart, Krynauw Otto, Breyton Paulse. Conversions: Franco Smith 4. Penalty: Smith.</p>
